      "fine_trace_step": 1,
      "description": "First vulnerability-relevant project read of attacker-controlled CFF state. `init()` has already accepted the CID `FDArray` and now materializes its count as the loop bound that drives how many `CFF1FontDictValues` objects will be pushed into `fontDicts`."
    },
